{"title": "Timmask Spores (cloud)", "pageid": 33716, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(cloud)", "categories": ["Clouds", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (disambiguation)\">Timmask Spores (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Timmask_Spores_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Timmask_Spores_cloud.png/300px-Timmask_Spores_cloud.png.webp, /w/images/3/31/Timmask_Spores_cloud.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Timmask Spores (cloud) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Timmask_Spores_cloud.png/300px-Timmask_Spores_cloud.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Timmask_Spores_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Timmask Spores</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloud\">cloud</a> that briefly befuddles all who pass through. Can be created by approaching or destroying a <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask\" title=\"Timmask\">Timmask</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Chance to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddle</a> creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Befuddled\"> Condition: Befuddled </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddled</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;10)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;10)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't control its actions and wanders around without direction.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Bamboozler\" title=\"Fungal Bamboozler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Bamboozler\" title=\"Fungal Bamboozler\">Fungal Bamboozler</a></span></li>\n<li><span cla